{
  "id": "E101",
  "title": "Spring Sleepiness",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-04-06",
  "synopsis": "Are you also feeling a bit extra sleepy in the spring?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/384/44651d41e8dc2cb3ba78a942618962a844207666.mp3?1491244410",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "春困\n\n安妮给小明打电话。\n安妮：喂，小明，快起床，我们该出发去春游了！\n小明：不行，我太困了。你们去吧，让我再睡会儿……\n安妮：别睡了！好不容易等到春天暖和起来，该出门走走了。\n小明：就是春天才犯困啊，你没听说过春困吗？\n安妮：什么春困？我觉得你一年到头都在犯困。\n小明：这很正常，“春困秋乏夏打盹，睡不醒的冬三月”。你看，古人都是这么说的。\n安妮：明明就是你懒，还拿古人当借口……\n小明：好吧好吧，你别唠叨了，我起床了。\n安妮：这才对嘛，出门走走就不困了！",
    "traditional": "春困\n\n安妮給小明打電話。\n安妮：喂，小明，快起床，我們該出發去春遊了！\n小明：不行，我太睏了。你們去吧，讓我再睡會兒……\n安妮：別睡了！好不容易等到春天暖和起來，該出門走走了。\n小明：就是春天才犯睏啊，你沒聽說過春困嗎？\n安妮：什麼春困？我覺得你一年到頭都在犯睏。\n小明：這很正常，“春困秋乏夏打盹，睡不醒的冬三月”。你看，古人都是這麼說的。\n安妮：明明就是你懶，還拿古人當借口……\n小明：好吧好吧，你別嘮叨了，我起床了。\n安妮：這才對嘛，出門走走就不睏了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Spring Sleepiness"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮给小明打电话。",
      "traditional": "安妮給小明打電話。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī gěi xiǎo míng dǎ diàn huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie is calling Little Ming."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：喂，小明，快起床，我们该出发去春游了！",
      "traditional": "安妮：喂，小明，快起床，我們該出發去春遊了！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wéi xiǎo míng kuài qǐ chuáng wǒ men gāi chū fā qù chūn yóu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Hi Little Ming, get up! We should leave for the spring outing."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：不行，我太困了。你们去吧，让我再睡会儿……",
      "traditional": "小明：不行，我太睏了。你們去吧，讓我再睡會兒……",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng bù xíng wǒ tài kùn le nǐ men qù ba ràng wǒ zài shuì huì'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: No, I’m too sleepy. You guys can go. Let me sleep some more."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：别睡了！好不容易等到春天暖和起来，该出门走走了。",
      "traditional": "安妮：別睡了！好不容易等到春天暖和起來，該出門走走了。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī bié shuì le hǎo bù róng yì děng dào chūn tiān nuǎn huo qǐ lái gāi chū mén zǒu zǒu le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Don’t sleep. It is finally spring and starting to get warm. It’s time to go outside."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：就是春天才犯困啊，你没听说过春困吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：就是春天才犯睏啊，你沒聽說過春困嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng jiù shì chūn tiān cái fàn kùn a nǐ méi tīng shuō guò chūn kùn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I’m sleepy because of spring. Haven’t you heard about “spring sleepiness”?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "安妮：什么春困？我觉得你一年到头都在犯困。",
      "traditional": "安妮：什麼春困？我覺得你一年到頭都在犯睏。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī shén me chūn kùn wǒ jué de nǐ yì nián dào tóu dōu zài fàn kùn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: What’s spring sleepiness? I feel like you are sleepy all year round."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "小明：这很正常，",
      "traditional": "小明：這很正常，",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng zhè hěn zhèng cháng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "“春困秋乏夏打盹，睡不醒的冬三月”。",
      "traditional": "“春困秋乏夏打盹，睡不醒的冬三月”。",
      "pinyin": "chūn kùn qiū fá xià dǎ dǔn shuì bù xǐng de dōng sān yuè",
      "english": "Little Ming: It is quite common."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "你看，古人都是这么说的。",
      "traditional": "你看，古人都是這麼說的。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn gǔ rén dōu shì zhè me shuō de",
      "english": "“Sleepy in spring, tired in autumn, taking a nap in summer, can’t stay awake for the three winter months.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You see? Even ancient people had these sayings."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "安妮：明明就是你懒，还拿古人当借口……",
      "traditional": "安妮：明明就是你懶，還拿古人當借口……",
      "pinyin": "ān nī míng míng jiù shì nǐ lǎn hái ná gǔ rén dāng jiè kǒu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Obviously it’s just because you are lazy. Don’t use ancient people as an excuse."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小明：好吧好吧，你别唠叨了，我起床了。",
      "traditional": "小明：好吧好吧，你別嘮叨了，我起床了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng hǎo ba hǎo ba nǐ bié láo dao le wǒ qǐ chuáng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Ok, don’t nag me any more. I’ll get up."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "安妮：这才对嘛，出门走走就不困了！",
      "traditional": "安妮：這才對嘛，出門走走就不睏了！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī zhè cái duì ma chū mén zǒu zǒu jiù bú kùn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: That’s right. Take a walk outdoors and you won’t feel sleepy!"
    }
  ],
